{
  "name": "Explode a list-valued column",
  "summary": "Split a semicolon list in one field into rows",
  "description": "Split a field whose value is an inner list (semicolon-separated here) into multiple rows, one per value, repeating the other columns. Turns 'id, a;b;c' into three rows. A CSV normalize-to-long transform.",
